{"articleNo":"1500","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1500&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010 대경권 선도산업 취업 페스티발 참관등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.11.22","hit":"11511","attachments":[{"name":"취업박람회 책자.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1500&attachNo=71400"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--> </p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 32pt\">[수정]2010 대경권 선도산업 취업 페스티발 참관등록 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -93.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;2010 대경권 선도산업 취업 페스티발 홈페이지가 아래와 같이 개설</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">되었으니 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #008080; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">참가기업의 면접에 참가를 희망하는 학생들은 사전 등록</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">하여</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -87.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 87.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 대 상 자 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #ff66ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2010 대경권 선도산업 취업 페스티발에 신청하여 참가 기업에 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff66ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">면접을 희망</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">하는 학생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -98.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 등록기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2010. 11. 23.(화) 12시까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -98.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 홈페이지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><a href=\"http://www.2010job.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.2010job.kr/</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -84.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 84.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 등록방법 : 해당 홈페이지 채용관-현장면접 사전신청<br>(지원하고자 하는 기업 중 택 1 하여 신청) </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -96.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 96.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">◈ 기&nbsp;&nbsp; 타 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">참가 기업 정보 및 행사 정보는 위의 홈페이지 또는 첨부파일의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">안내 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">책자를 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">취업페스티발 모집기간은 11/22(월)까지이며 현재 신청한 학생들 전원</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 참가 가능합니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -34.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 34.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 취</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">업페스티발 참가 희망자 중 센터 참여학생이 아닌 경우 버스</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 여석이 남을 경우 참가 가능하며, 그 외에는 개별 이동하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><u><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">취업준비서류는 신청하고자 하는 기업별로 각 1부씩 출력하여 지참하시기</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 바랍니다.</span></u></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 문의사항은 센터 방문 또는 478-7948로 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2010. 11. 22.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
